    "detailed_description": "[Game Plot]<br>Little Blue Hair works in a company that doesn\u2019t respect its employees, and his boss always makes excessive demands.<br>Finally, one day, he decides to resign and leave this place.<br>But will everything go smoothly?<br><br>[Game Content]<br>\u201cEscapism Ltd.\u201d is a highly challenging 2D platform jumping game. Players can control the character, using skills like jumping, dashing, and climbing to find a way out in a work area full of traps.<br>In adventure mode, players can gradually explore and overcome challenges. At the same time, players can also collect envelopes to achieve various achievements.<br>In speedrun mode, players only need to rush to the finish line, helping the character escape at the fastest speed. The clearance time will enter the leaderboard for global PK.<br><br>[Game Features]<br>- Cute pixel art style<br>- Highly challenging level design<br>- The story of escaping a toxic work environment",
    "about_the_game": "[Game Plot]<br>Little Blue Hair works in a company that doesn\u2019t respect its employees, and his boss always makes excessive demands.<br>Finally, one day, he decides to resign and leave this place.<br>But will everything go smoothly?<br><br>[Game Content]<br>\u201cEscapism Ltd.\u201d is a highly challenging 2D platform jumping game. Players can control the character, using skills like jumping, dashing, and climbing to find a way out in a work area full of traps.<br>In adventure mode, players can gradually explore and overcome challenges. At the same time, players can also collect envelopes to achieve various achievements.<br>In speedrun mode, players only need to rush to the finish line, helping the character escape at the fastest speed. The clearance time will enter the leaderboard for global PK.<br><br>[Game Features]<br>- Cute pixel art style<br>- Highly challenging level design<br>- The story of escaping a toxic work environment",
    "short_description": "This is a pixel-style platformer. Players control Little Blue Hair, who has been tormented by work and finally made up his mind to resign. Using skills such as jumping, dashing, and climbing, he finds a way out and escapes from the maze-like work area.",
